# Development may omit this setting and use http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# Every build (including custom modes) requires an explicit API origin.
# Deployed hosts require HTTPS, for example https://api.example.com.
# HTTP is accepted in builds only for localhost, 127.0.0.1 or [::1] testing.
# No /api prefix, credentials, query, fragment or wildcard. A trailing / is removed.
# VITE_ settings are public build-time values: never put secrets here.
# Rebuild after changing this value; configure the backend's CORS allowlist too.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
